{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b2315c61b40203e71cccedc1fdcd39af8453831719daf9f26277aa978eebd9c1",
      "source_sha256": "74318951072916a5d21eabfe82decbe4fc2a9d4195a17991154a4f4973095c63",
      "translation": "啊，呼，真是累死了。每天光是耕地……一天就这么过去了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f07d21b83bdc3247fdc8c023b183f30230159b180718ed96d2c85ce8b46ce9b5",
      "source_sha256": "e113ef137aed2f1c5c96bfe9fe4c47c8cbfad5f38227ca3e1cc8e4b9af392cec",
      "translation": "这里还算好的呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54504280e2258aae42e0587362a03a9c50d2f5337e1310126309e578e604dcea",
      "source_sha256": "c78b7ffb2dddb9241e68011a42eff0c4119e060f30922ab5e5180113778bb14e",
      "translation": "是叫贝尔福特吧？听说，那里去年闹了瘟疫。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7ee84a8f6dfa3360a968c132629f38ec53684af80798fb6526fb4394fd5943dd",
      "source_sha256": "0dfd8b9026a6739a28b4b54e08463c2e5d36af52d8fe0d89ec86caff26dbc0e3",
      "translation": "连环术也用不了，想治病都不行。听说，死了好几十个人……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:97a27eaf6ba02b870e01c93967fba803d33bf0238c1be9b1dd33d6f76ac09a6f",
      "source_sha256": "c03e1b934939c367537f0b0ddd7960afeb7d547d9cb959fc5ba1dabc31506b3a",
      "translation": "听说，这都是因为那个公主没死？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bcfa498dd6b3afdcd7718c7cf4764413b750ea2e5e6b2e025b8bf151768af30a",
      "source_sha256": "6e10cceeee0c2682cfdf5ff3f79197782d6a78779b151961f9edd96e59c98d21",
      "translation": "拉·斯特拉达坠落，也是公主和她那帮人干的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f16f2d8083607da78cb19d5dfca047d745356365570ddcd9520f8756b041ba5d",
      "source_sha256": "ca96ce2281ec164c53b4a45ee7f9a189cf29f1f26bdebd6e2344afae9bb4239a",
      "translation": "都是那些家伙，才害我们落到这种地步！我们一直都被蒙在鼓里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ad67106a8f94e5790bf8ac79e1423036b2d86011736aaa53aa06df204a644e7",
      "source_sha256": "4d0dbb3d012ac553f5a679cb37ce2e18bb7bef37e4bce90061ed82d9de7aaaee",
      "translation": "我还以为，那个女人能拯救世界呢……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:913280c8eef9b7d3da6cdb9e03d159318e319ca78a0101b8a284878781072b7e",
      "source_sha256": "3cf1f987f40a7d8e21a1637a2f3de6271eda002c2196ea61d5aed538a6e0e692",
      "translation": "可是……不是说，公主不死，世界就会毁灭吗？但世界，并没有毁灭啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:664a4c92a1ba72ad0d8c8811f4a774d4182e3b53c7e170dd5c8486a095ce3daa",
      "source_sha256": "15ea7897310637e260a406ed5d4102767abb02300d02291a0c002d5dba1d99b5",
      "translation": "那又有什么用？我们现在，不还是这么辛苦！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:430f9b168565c4588ef4c600dfccb2930e6d634ab3eaa8272de3d1abe1d72dbe",
      "source_sha256": "a92bcef9a3ba49c4e09876b4d66442d4581940d669c091220ff88c6161d6aea3",
      "translation": "蕾洁菲尔妲大人……您没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df25528313a863d4aa170b90fa47048714e3b34b13e5b80c739a9a659bcf0aaa",
      "source_sha256": "0cdda661b5e8bfd52f1276bcaad08e60b9892f705380e5b4d11abf27542e428c",
      "translation": "嗯，我已经没事了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bbed7637c3138f70672adf0da6b07b69d1c763a28e6578dc0ed518772c32eac6",
      "source_sha256": "7d45dda5d6eddc9bd746b9181e6e27603cd957ab681758b90116549f3b47b110",
      "translation": "距离那一天，已经过去3年……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f51aaa6134abe145b6d665f8de84d5ba026ce0f3d50d168300de8c35874b67f2",
      "source_sha256": "5778a958936bba8773c4b5abe1e11632f84c5cae8193af3f5f31eacebf458b8e",
      "translation": "正如修恩扎伊特警告的那样，人们必须亲手耕种土地，连环术的奇迹，也消失了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d82767c08033e93c107703b5af8c159d2073f373b6ecae3b5df88f8865a26072",
      "source_sha256": "744135a5603900d1a3641235930af72dec59e18e204c201833ff74ba8cb5a261",
      "translation": "卡尔玛被弃置，哨兵陷入了沉睡……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9de35dee2536460e229d2566211dad960739dcde5a85e9acbae0a8fe6183854e",
      "source_sha256": "4687096294cea60b61e2966802679d00616d6f72b10b45a3a9706d6347c56a58",
      "translation": "源源不断涌现的灾祸种，终于也不再出现。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96ac8d190a2ecd21fb18d7bb32467c34387495228756d7ec08883a3d3c774c00",
      "source_sha256": "5589a0d8c1f9562825f0b0378013c416648e267aa33dcf22f0db71af6f48cb22",
      "translation": "但是，世界存续了下来。随着时间这样流逝，过去的兰兹海姆，终究也会被遗忘吧……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a0e16e88280c78edea458d6010459f5e8ba6eac021f72c261db55e327348a77",
      "source_sha256": "d2fd00800bff83ace3610ac869f291e153049fc421db05aa5614920b84a8f6ce",
      "translation": "姐姐～～！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:393dc211f4d19e62fee416666cae9f8c23f1b73460423edc84fa60a29a91dc31",
      "source_sha256": "5797467051377233060560953d700c21684e4e6d24e0a3b45f159e9fff0d2eea",
      "translation": "好久不见，塞蕾丝汀。过得好吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0bf0236fb1dea25b8ab33de61eb6e955c7bab0eaf5632f44d5a4b673d054da47",
      "source_sha256": "76a8834fa3236c09275fbadfc556ee81207492615246dbdde01dc14843888536",
      "translation": "当然～！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3ee76bf58950da771270d64589b964d15a29d29ff9d6ba61001f9b0669fa2248",
      "source_sha256": "968eee627f56149b860e57c5f6997c03aec8a0524afecc32e78c3956be1a31f6",
      "translation": "我最近，真的好幸福～幸福得，甚至有点害怕。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8346eb6a61d6f40a567287743587fe4c3b2721feb8da8baa1221e93ef8af59b3",
      "source_sha256": "a55ad583befe151a2f613ccaabfc11e8ef37ec6ef7de15c5fc8329a5374f3f3f",
      "translation": "是吗？我倒觉得，阿尔戈憔悴了不少。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d289a6fec562e5065ce201439ac816a9344341742af441ea91e1921cc7f52d82",
      "source_sha256": "6c022a27cbe32d018bed9bd49a86271c3dd55e0bdccf8f80e578a7c33536e541",
      "translation": "咦～？我每天都做特别的好菜，怎么会这样……！？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a23148441550dcede686270acb17ca82680b61a21da657638fe224a040b567f4",
      "source_sha256": "84ad27f89e8a889b260306eb6ce7e49fbcedcbdc59b3455721b3e3bcc4349b97",
      "translation": "开玩笑的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b872417779404a014479404dc1624d38a6cb351b32597f26f2fd20627ef76cd6",
      "source_sha256": "794c74999c8cebdc5d87dadb16b0b3fde3621dea7f26fcf08118a61bf4202bf5",
      "translation": "哈哈哈，露姐姐竟然也会开玩笑？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8c1e62cdbe65edf83b63ce9ca66d56eac7a79203e8bb46f1d01a6e3b1d57c0db",
      "source_sha256": "2df63eeecfd42dd1c3460a30ae7dde02755d0b876b3f567d2da8d2d6436c8b0c",
      "translation": "3年，可是很长的时间。人总是会变的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:79bfe77e300c2d4faa940160a4e028ae08fc52d3bbdf005e6ae983f35c541df2",
      "source_sha256": "83a9b95d1adb69bf59d4751ed3697fd7739430a550e379c24b6b30307e32c131",
      "translation": "过得好吗，阿尔戈？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be3be84fb307087054ca6fb62efc7fbd1bab0d48a3b2f12022e10d346ac5e0e1",
      "source_sha256": "e1299e3bb24919bdd12201cc32719543ed20ad39247c79049d16d88d32851ef8",
      "translation": "嗯。你看起来，也还不错。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e99848a388d3f76e68958383e981ca2cdb37f90f2925793ef0a7c10c3bc3dc35",
      "source_sha256": "8025c713f26164a6787608a6cbce1b8ac0cfe963a42e1416578db60193e95224",
      "translation": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f501adc10fbc30b2e7b81f5f64c7d6cc6914c9357823fb8bd4ca5f19da06590",
      "source_sha256": "7fcdca2e0efe00351ccff27773c2d7dd6668c4a1d94b11d0864e7cc4775f2d61",
      "translation": "虽然承受着全世界的怨恨，让我有些心痛，但我并不后悔。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bbf70ef90028e4a06b707d08f072d5191b8069e634507263d832bf72850c44cb",
      "source_sha256": "5a7e885d48e494f7784457f1f011fd06328b5bcf55934cc8ffabfc913ee82898",
      "translation": "不久后，我就会造出能在地面上，飞快奔驰的机器～！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f16ab67c68f95da113204fe65c6b73b325bf0343b537c0f887b08b0a199c6e89",
      "source_sha256": "39b5ea86b59d3443d506000b6ded98fd654ac5864bf0313900c14ab19df2dd2e",
      "translation": "要是顺利，说不定还能飞上天空！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca51680c8b14aecb55a195ea4988215192215c91d6fb8d099bbbbbd42c539dd3",
      "source_sha256": "ae85c6897c83afe9eddf4f66288b99272e46dbecf11ab228612294061187a548",
      "translation": "怎么样？很厉害吧？很帅吧？最棒了吧？了不起吧～？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9e5d9b580bdef3b81a6087fa4200c718decaf2785163c9532af437c75f1be735",
      "source_sha256": "f5b13086e7e5635d857f9e2d9c59d9d440b8ff8a5006219c63fd95640d3bdf3d",
      "translation": "要是正式开发起来，应该就能代替卡尔玛了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c53d8e4781a8ab7ee0aeeb386c41e2110dced7d8621d4be4ea754ea808132e5a",
      "source_sha256": "1f875fe73a1a2943980acc73d4d96eed3e04e14380ddb2ac8ac82fd4e93a1734",
      "translation": "敬请期待！我们阿维斯的机器，将会统治这个世界。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4c4aa1b19d0d5dee756db94c4de47544bb759180b0c16244d0ae5afe8e46bebd",
      "source_sha256": "d0a73c2ff450db7bdb85c4e4ded5197b90eafc55ca7a348635b9d4d5ef8f8bbb",
      "translation": "真厉害啊，竟然能飞上天空。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6582c4ef3e10a15838095646c908934dd9c103c43136aa854f15e65792302085",
      "source_sha256": "51de6be589a6417218cb9a4e909aaca67e29fa48676c0c9e2e4a4696b9c2e4dc",
      "translation": "最近，大家都很关注，阿维斯发明的那些便利机器。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:047418c29458beadab428da529c13de1fb2f98b9230872ed235c894de330281f",
      "source_sha256": "1f308068a95a420425aef218f97a0109666a21331dd522f33dc779f1a458352d",
      "translation": "这么说来，最近也经常有人类，进出柯塔马雷呢。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6912ae76ed75f228f55a1c920b0aeb376ada986d34a11c18fcd099b4ebd050ae",
      "source_sha256": "cbf21d7353b7d8720c68281843506afd64efe319072c0fd6dd3046b86041b703",
      "translation": "没错，没错。用不了连环术，治病就不像以前那么容易了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cb2fb5ee96f230e70f5256d7c4a1678346c3897cb546855368b5aff0f89c7c08",
      "source_sha256": "7b887829f26d0dc78d3219d60d5cb0b1b5cc3aaa9dcb92ba3c88f98bd4d630cb",
      "translation": "所以，马雷族丰富的药草知识，在人类中大受欢迎～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:789f28fa6b731294d0c443326f25e12549ebffdf912f69b53eb931a2d5588c94",
      "source_sha256": "8826b67124f4c24e6aeb7b02abe2dbb632f3d0eb77e9557884e05b1338aca355",
      "translation": "我最近卖药，也赚了不少呢！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae2b60a2dc1c479cb95641554ccb2dbf7bb9a95b6293cdcba7141475927844b0",
      "source_sha256": "46d35ccdaeb024bf146ebb5ab6305a63b87bc6422117297c1e852c0dd4c13fb8",
      "translation": "原本封闭的马雷族，也渐渐开始和人类交流了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fe559a1e6c961b35eca5b66b848a60974b3ed54acbcbfa859df618d3d500ce35",
      "source_sha256": "a5e6cf141c272d4c602b3d6f9a726ba1ba56264ab4099a1ee3b06e87ff8db584",
      "translation": "嗯。今后，马雷族的药，会代替治愈连环术。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a27689d5ea15c98aa9e6f77bc0b8930804a2a06539cf4dfd47b84b1069859ce3",
      "source_sha256": "e8e0d46c4d1a35b10350bf3088a2c61fec2240ea52494cdbd2734dcf5b5840fb",
      "translation": "人类，比斯特拉斯想象的更加坚强。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:28d959b88bf736c6a0ae0a2570c259b980d9dc81b977b1d44463d29c563f4fde",
      "source_sha256": "fe7a7fb3af88ed0ff84109508144265c95f4e924cd86e89f019f82641cbfccde",
      "translation": "即使环境改变，也会顽强地适应下去，开拓新的道路。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b4998cc7bd906ec3c42026d04bec51735e2b93f94bda671132fa581fcb8b31ec",
      "source_sha256": "48b37c811bc53f7a2dfdde7cbe62bc9e0588d5484ac5a34c8f33e38f7b0d6277",
      "translation": "直到现在，我仍然坚信，我们的选择是正确的……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7fcbe5e302f0e0847e56eee463b58a632e1cd2989a45a40b6b58e10764482db7",
      "source_sha256": "43732a734942599ef2561c312ad342fb4b182fc693345030934209784ce2de50",
      "translation": "虽然还需要时间，但总有一天，都会恢复的吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:08eee9673a4741060c94d4430ec7b03f4d5869d9d6721bf20745fb0180cb9eaa",
      "source_sha256": "75fd132fa2d5127481668527b4d56bba3fd83b0fe689fc3f0f03b3468f07c33c",
      "translation": "比起那些，真正麻烦的，是那群自称为王，互相打来打去的家伙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c013ba263cfd2f6bdf98fe2861d8bed55384ce3e2b23afd9d52ab9a5993cb4fb",
      "source_sha256": "29bd2381d1f9da2b88e65e94769a38b4c488325350fff47fb2d518849c669fea",
      "translation": "所以，最近相邻的城市，才会互相结盟吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:912ab33a204b328e33de98d35e0d7d8163c7faffc91df56ebdda019224d78c25",
      "source_sha256": "454dd0912b0301c225a26b52249369b6f7fde447762e4cdd77c20233cef9e0da",
